Follow `md-extensions/.cursor/skills/md-module-extraction/` (+ `.claude/skills/` / `.github/skills/`) + `docs/MIGRATED_MODULES.md` + `docs/REUSABLE_FROM_USERS_AND_GROUPS.md`.
